,"\"0.337452367\"","\"0.202475631\"","\"0.183660252\"","\"0.0402331\"","\"1.589384031\"","\"3.18259207\"","\"0.071783747\"","\"0.985379104\"","\"3.95729876\"","\"0.91130316\"","\"0.155681948\"","\"6.461944789\"","\"Explicit qualified opinion over Income Tax Act depreciation with unascertained profitability impact; auditor says loss although PL records profit. Retirement benefit obligation not quantified or accounted under AS15; pay-as-you-go. Material historic accounting limitation.\"","\"2022\"","\"FY23 comparative\"","\"FY23 annual report PDF16–17\"","\"16.2738429\"","\"0.0571976\"","\"0.3787829\"","\"0.2038958\"","\"0.4094125\"","\"0.0476671\"","\"1.7932798\"","\"4.1346834\"","\"0.3160044\"","\"1.6065281\"","\"4.1309625\"","\"1.0270173\"","\"0.1338816\"","\"7.822562\"","\"FY22 original PL PDF16 shows finance cost37.42756 lakh versus FY23 comparative40.94125; revenue/PBT/PAT agree to rounding. Expenses regrouped; preserve vintages. Original FY22 cash31.6004385, AR160.652805, debt413.468343.\"","\"2023\"","\"FY23 original\"","\"16.4320829\"","\"0.1061383\"","\"0.3866102\"","\"0.2834435\"","\"0.7589011\"","\"0.0572244\"","\"2.0767233\"","\"10.7016757\"","\"4.0118386\"","\"1.2373428\"","\"5.874898\"","\"1.0958945\"","\"0.1584407\"","\"14.4697039\"","\"Audited statement signature block still says as per books subject to audit, but attached unmodified auditor opinion/signature/date verified; do not treat template wording as separate audit opinion.\"","\"Do not present FY24–26 mixed-perimeter ratio-of-sums as constant-scope performance. FY24–25 is matched standalone, FY26 matched consolidated individually. Original FY21–23 are separate un-restated vintages.\"","\"Operating EBITDA = PBT + all finance cost + D&A − other income. Operating EBIT = EBITDA − operating D&A (exclude investment-property depreciation). Normalized PAT removes all other income after25.17% analytical tax; no favourable add-back of recurring penalties or statutory interest.\"","\"4.8882\"","\"9.0020\"","\"16.6580\"","\".0227\"","\".0216\"","\".0205\"","\"2.8802\"","\"4.5099\"","\"5.7954\"","\".4429\"","\".4213\"","\".4008\"","\"adjustments\"","\"pre_wc_cash\"","\"loans_advances\"","\"other_assets\"","\"other_liabilities\"","\"cash_before_tax\"","\"tax_refund_positive\"","\"net_acquisition_cash\"","\"rent\"","\"interest_income\"","\"debt_inflow\"","\"debt_repayment\"","\"cash_interest\"","\"net_change\"","\"reported_cfi\"","\"sum_investing_rows\"","\"reported_less_row_sum\"","\"reported_cff\"","\"reported_total_change\"","\"row_sum_total_change\"","\"reconciliation_status\"","\"2.7319\"","\"16.3669\"","\"-1.0009\"","\".5959\"","\"-36.8281\"","\"-.8298\"","\"18.4675\"","\"-3.8060\"","\"-7.0345\"","\"1.9384\"","\"-.6216\"","\".0660\"","\".0178\"","\".3442\"","\"17.1844\"","\"-10.0153\"","\"-1.9353\"","\".0128\"","\"-.1249\"","\"-.1936\"","\".0687\"","\"5.2338\"","\"-.0559\"","\"Reported subtotals reconcile to cash change; individual investing rows fall short by ₹0.0687 crore. Unresolved primary arithmetic discrepancy, not silently repaired.\"","\"consideration\"","\"unpaid_at_close\"","\"subsidiary_net_assets\"","\"capital_reserve\"","\"subsidiary_post_acquisition_loss\"","\"acquired_inventory\"","\"acquired_gratuity\"","\"acquired_cash\"","\"residual_explanation\"","\"2026-03-30\"","\"9.4628\"","\"4.3503\"","\"-.0589\"","\".7947\"","\".0543\"","\"Net assets at acquisition9.5217 minus consideration5.1714 = capital reserve4.3503; closing net assets9.4628 plus post-acquisition loss reversal. AR balance delta56.9814 minus CF movement36.8281 =20.1533 acquired/perimeter residual, not organic cash absorption. Full receivable acquisition/elimination schedule ND.\"","\"verticals\"","\"concentration\"","\"franchise_centres\"","\"direct_centres\"","\"customer_retention_percent\"","\"subscription_ARR\"","\"subscription_renewal_rate\"","\"separately_priced_IP_revenue\"","\"funded_executable_backlog\"","\"labs\"","\"subscriptions\"","\"other_services\"","\"32.2526\"","\"5.9133\"","\"53.2461\"","\"2.0917\"","\"3.4150\"","\"72.0167\"","\"11.9284\"","\"9.2780\"","\"top1\"","\"top10\"","\"maharashtra\"","\"rpt_sales\"","\".5747\"","\".9660\"","\".8986\"","\"21.9281\"","\".5530\"","\".9295\"","\".8728\"","\"33.7505\"","\".2111\"","\".7799\"","\".5304\"","\"RHP printed 25–26,120–135; RFS38–39\"","\"School reach counts and centre aspirations are not contracts, subscriber cohorts, license ARR or executable backlog. No SaaS multiple assigned.\"","\"price_date\"","\"price_source\"","\"shares_source\"","\"reference_position_inr\"","\"market_cap_formula\"","\"public_trading_start\"","\"primary_20_60_session_tape\"","\"spread\"","\"depth\"","\"current_ASM_GSM_restrictions\"","\"L_score\"","\"post_cutoff_events\"","\"https://ticker.finology.in/Company/SCRIP-325713\"","\"Secondary observed close reference, not an executable quote or exchange-verified close; BSE files unavailable\"","\"NSE official interoperability security master dated 2026-10-19 ISIN INE1W8R01018; corroborated RHP and mirrored BSE listing notice 20260925-42\"","\"500000\"","\"price×current issued shares /10000000\"","\"2026-09-28\"","\"ND; listing age is less than 20 sessions, so 60-session measure NA, not zero volume\"","\"ND\"","\"ND; initial 10-day trade-for-trade notice does not establish current status\"","\"Excluded: October 21–23 prices and October 22 clarification request\"","\"unit\"","\"starting_shares\"","\"entry_shares\"","\"authorized_shares\"","\"anchor_date\"","\"entry_date\"","\"terminal_date\"","\"cash_floor\"","\"initial\"","\"tax\"","\"operating_da_rate\"","\"maintenance_rate\"","\"growth_fixed_rate\"","\"supplier_advance_rate\"","\"customer_advance_rate\"","\"old_debt_rate\"","\"optional_debt_rate\"","\"bank_cap\"","\"equity_gross_cap\"","\"equity_price_discount\"","\"equity_fee\"","\"cycles\"","\"preentry\"","\"terminal\"","\"scenarios\"","\"₹ crore, INR/share, integer shares; all future and unobserved bridge economics are analyst assumptions\"","7000000","12000000","\"2026-03-31\"","\"2031-10-19\"","\".20\"","\"ar\"","\"ap\"","\"supplier_advance\"","\"customer_advance\"","\"fixed\"","\"tax_payable\"","\"1.4603\"","\".2517\"","\".0045\"","\".007\"","\".01\"","\".0306\"","\".00365\"","\".13\"","\".17\"","\"3\"","\"10\"","\".25\"","\".03\"","8","\"annual_revenue\"","\"margin\"","\"dso\"","\"inventory_days\"","\"ap_days\"","\"collection_before_cost\"","\"ipo_fee\"","\"pay_acquisition_date\"","\"old_tax_installments\"","\"old_statutory_installments\"","\"old_debt_repayment\"","\"preentry_optional_bank_cap\"","\"ocd_rate\"","\"ocd_cash\"","\"ocd_issue_date\"","\"ocd_conversion_date\"","\"ocd_new_shares\"","\"ocd_conversion_cash\"","\"ipo_date\"","\"ipo_gross\"","\"ipo_new_shares\"","\"equity_april9_cash\"","\"equity_april9_shares\"","\"equity_april15_cash\"","\"equity_april15_shares\"","\"note\"","\"105\"","\".15\"","\"260\"","\"55\"","\"80\"","\".8\"","7","\"2.2\"","\".10\"","\"4.4999955\"","\"2026-04-09\"","\"2026-09-05\"","582900","\"31.08768\"","2932800","\".000024\"","\"2.75\"","343750","\"Known issue dates/amounts from RHP; IPO cash availability date/fee, unobserved revenue/cash/tax/acquisition payments and rollover are conditional assumptions. Never add OCD cash a second time on conversion.\"","\"growth\"","\"discount\"","\"cash_buffer_fraction\"","\"next_reinvestment_prefunded\"","\"all_debt_repaid_before_ordinary_equity\"","\"no_interim_dividend\"","\"reserve_semantics\"","\".16\"","\".02\"","false","true","\"Permanent minimum operating cash, at least 2% of next revenue and enough for the next-year dated peak cash deficit. Next capex and working capital enter FCFF once; no separate reinvestment prefunding deduction.\"","\"bear\"","\"base\"","\"bull\"","\"initial_ar_haircut\"","\"rollover\"","\"360\"","\"85\"","\"50\"","\".5\"","\".80\"","\"240\"","\"70\"","\"1\"","\".18\"","\"180\"","\"45\"","\".9\"","\"factors\"","\"gates\"","\"caps\"","\"cap_reason\"","\"hurdle\"","\"REV_window\"","\"confidence\"","\"evidence\"","\"basis\"","\"contrary\"","\"Medium\"","\"E01\"","\"E02\"","\"E03\"","\"Original FY21 qualification; recurring restatements, bank-return differences, statutory/MSME interest and director appointment during disclosed disqualification weaken stewardship. FY25 RPT sales exceeded half of revenue and acquisition consideration is owed to KMP.\"","\"No proven diversion; latest examination says no qualifications requiring adjustment, acquired net assets exceed consideration, fresh IPO has no OFS, and disclosures expose rather than conceal these facts.\"","\"E04\"","\"E05\"","\"Laboratory implementation and school relationships provide useful delivery know-how. Most revenue remains contestable project supply; majority of customers have no binding long-term agreements.\"","\"In-house kit design, curriculum and platforms differentiate service, but pricing premium, renewal cohorts, independently monetized IP and durable switching costs are not established.\"","\"Low\"","\"E06\"","\"Five-year window chosen first; FY21 is pandemic-distorted with accounting qualification. Three-year fallback crosses a last-day related-party acquisition and changing sales/elimination perimeter. Nominal growth is calculated, but verified organic growth is NS.\"","\"Labs, subscriptions and non-Maharashtra revenue expanded strongly; NS is not an allegation that growth was fictitious.\"","\"E07\"","\"Existing institutional delivery and subscription growth establish some access to STEM demand; two franchise and two direct centres are operating.\"","\"Tender budgets, concentrated counterparties and long collections limit accessible growth; no binding funded backlog or renewals supports a large TAM claim.\"","\"E08\"","\"Full capital and acquisition obligations are included in numerical proxies, but late consolidation mismatches closing capital with almost no acquired-period income. Reliable cohort returns and organic incremental denominator are unavailable.\"","\"Reported operating margins and returns improve. That does not prove an attractive return on new school labs, software or franchises.\"","\"High\"","\"E09\"","\"Restated FY24–26 CFO is negative each year and FY24–25 matched standalone cumulative conversion is negative. Large receivables and costly funding demonstrate repeated poor realization, not capex inside CFO.\"","\"FY25 collected earlier receivables and FY26 tax cash is a refund; higher sales can explain some investment, but do not reverse the multiyear cash deficit.\"","\"E10\"","\"March cash equivalents are only 0.2187 crore; restricted deposits cannot be netted. IPO/pre-IPO finance helps, but current cash/debt, acquisition payment, arrears and callable line rollovers remain unverified.\"","\"No disclosed default/wilful-defaulter conclusion; completed fresh IPO is real funding, so modeled conditional deficits do not establish actual insolvency.\"","\"Project revenue and live centre launches demonstrate operating delivery, and the issuer completed its IPO. Named milestones are audited or dated, not invented earnings guidance.\"","\"Recurring late-deployment charges, cash realization and no post-IPO utilization report verified by cutoff prevent a stronger execution score.\"","\"Operating earnings increased and other income is a small share of FY26 PBT. Current-share EPS is reconstructed instead of mixing weighted shares around bonus/loan conversion.\"","\"Restatements, supplier/statutory costs, acquired scope and significant new shares weaken confidence in repeatable per-share earnings.\"","\"E11\"","\"No unconditional cash-feasible base IRR is established at the secondary price; early financing and terminal continuation are conditional.\"","\"Conditional collection/improved-margin paths and explicit hurdles are modeled without replacing R with a hand-picked successful result.\"","\"Receivable collectability, customer loss, callable credit and costly rescue can jointly impair capital. Bear paths exhaust bounded finance and have no ordinary equity return.\"","\"IPO cash, customer diversification and realizable receivables can cushion loss; this is a risk assessment, not a liquidation recovery appraisal.\"","\"E12\"","\"The approximately 16× historical earnings reference is observable only conditionally, while organic earning base and investable entry cash are unresolved. Reverse paths quantify assumptions rather than declaring the stock cheap.\"","\"The price does not necessarily require a SaaS premium; successful high-margin/collection cases exist but are not independently supported.\"","\"Official ISIN/share/lot verified, but no complete primary traded-value history, spread/depth or current restriction file. Listing age is under 20 sessions; no 60-session statistic can be fabricated.\"","\"Secondary tape shows trades and lot size is 1200, so it is not declared suspended or untradeable.\"","\"G1\"","\"G2\"","\"G3\"","\"G4\"","\"reason\"","\"Conditional\"","\"Documented compliance and stewardship weaknesses; no severe diversion/minority abuse established. GOV 4, not automatic governance cap.\"","\"Hold — unresolved\"","\"Original FY25 CF financing misclassification and original/restated cash vintage, audit lender mismatch, acquisition/perimeter reconciliation and current entry balance cannot be fully resolved.\"","\"IPO proceeds are real but current usage/rollovers and pre-entry settlements are not verified. Conditional model breaches are not evidenced actual funding failure.\"","\"Lot known; secondary close is not executable, full primary tape/current restrictions unavailable; no suspension inferred.\"","\"CASH 2 reflects persistent poor realization, so GQS capped at 5. Missing scores remainNS; no hidden governance or funding cap.\"","\"Preselected 5-year comparable organic;3-year fallback if distorted. Both nominal diagnostics retained, neither verified as underlying organic demand.\"","\"id\"","\"title\"","\"url\"","\"document_date\"","\"reviewed\"","\"type\"","\"cutoff_eligible\"","\"AR22\"","\"Annual Report – FY 2021-22 (PDF)\"","\"https://www.robokidz.co.in/media/documents/04-annual-report-fy-2021-22.pdf\"","\"FY ended 2022-03-31\"","\"917e81cb4eae0638cbcca494923ba1df7fa0d06f8689a1a4b0676bfb09e626e6\"","\"Entire original audit/opinion, CARO/IFC where applicable, financial statements and relevant notes. Original report issuer identity and units checked. Original versus restated vintages preserved.\"","\"V\"","\"AR23\"","\"Annual Report – FY 2022-23 (PDF)\"","\"https://www.robokidz.co.in/media/documents/03-annual-report-fy-2022-23.pdf\"","\"FY ended 2023-03-31\"","\"cadcdc2af1d39d714a6c071295d2c6b1a46707d55b1b1d676b5f9e9b085d424d\"","\"AR24\"","\"Annual Report – FY 2023-24 (PDF)\"","\"https://www.robokidz.co.in/media/documents/02-annual-report-fy-2023-24.pdf\"","\"FY ended 2024-03-31\"","\"c044803427a8b074ee2ff21928504cf714e41a4bb46b0889a2189a54184b3ab1\"","\"ADD\"","\"Addendum to DRHP (PDF)\"","\"https://www.robokidz.co.in/media/documents/04-addendum-to-drhp.pdf\"","\"2026 pre-RHP\"","\"847452145e3c95affb8549162300875e1577a7cbdfdd000b5094cff0af4786ce\"","\"Disqualification, revised risk/RPT and business disclosures.\"","\"RHP\"","\"RHP (PDF)\"","\"https://www.robokidz.co.in/media/documents/03-rhp.pdf\"","\"2026-09-11\"","\"fe7971f7c2229075c1508aa1d7b0169835280c311f53e37e8c50e22454b84adb\"","\"RHP front matter, risks, capital structure, objects, business, history, governance, entire restated examination report and RFS1–54, MDA, litigation, approvals.\"","\"AR21\"","\"Annual Report – FY 2020-21 (PDF)\"","\"https://www.robokidz.co.in/media/documents/05-annual-report-fy-2020-21.pdf\"","\"FY ended 2021-03-31\"","\"536c9ce40ed894bbe4b73c2a3f84ac5e802d0f49ae8a7ccb34d1a3ff7507b0b3\"","\"WRONG-AUDIT\"","\"Audit Report – FY 2024-25 (PDF)\"","\"https://www.robokidz.co.in/media/documents/06-audit-report-fy-2024-25.pdf\"","\"FY2025\"","\"973a349ed358275890e9579d152d62e324ebeac626d7747264e0830f90116d75\"","\"Identity check only: linked file belongs to Bharat Gyan Vigyan Foundation, not issuer. Excluded from issuer opinion conclusions.\"","\"AR25\"","\"Annual Report – FY 2024-25 (PDF)\"","\"https://www.robokidz.co.in/media/documents/01-annual-report-fy-2024-25.pdf\"","\"FY ended 2025-03-31\"","\"32d7a4d0fbb3970951b31c5ccc9aa87edd05f488b7409c5d7e22818f8df29663\"","\"SEC\"","\"NSE interoperability security master\"","\"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/content/cm/interop/NSE_CM_security_19102026.csv.gz\"","\"d3665d120c8b0379df3483321ad45f8230535c7124b9759de5c29961df326898\"","\"Exact ISIN, issued shares and lot; not represented as a separate NSE listing or executable quote.\"","\"MKT\"","\"Finology observed quote\"","\"Observed secondary price ₹149.80; displayed legacy P/E and debt are not adopted.\"","\"secondary quote / mirror / management business description\"","\"LIST\"","\"BSE listing notice 20260925-42, mirrored by NoticeBlue\"","\"https://noticeblue.com/circulars/a3fbe800-ded3-4528-bf13-09db1a43f494\"","\"2026-09-25\"","\"10,859,453 shares, 1,200-share lot, ₹106 issue price and September 28 listing. Official endpoint unavailable; mirror labeled.\"","\"PEER-MTS\"","\"NIIT Learning Systems FY26 results\"","\"https://www.niit.com/en/learning-outsourcing/news-details/niit-mts-q4-fy26-financial-results/\"","\"2026-05-12\"","\"09a9ee13f7b5b7685c158f14143ab44337b736661f8ecbadfcfc70df7ceacef0\"","\"Issuer FY26 results: ₹1,952 crore revenue, ₹395.7 crore EBITDA, ₹247.7 crore PAT; 21 new annuity clients and USD459 million visibility. Corporate services comparator, not a lab-project multiple.\"","\"PEER-NIIT\"","\"NIIT Limited FY26 results\"","\"https://www.niit.ai/india/press-release/niit-limited-q4-fy2025-26-consolidated-results\"","\"2026-05-14\"","\"1625d6115f079cdc99e6ba5dbc375b4e507078ecf1f187843b058107c9300697\"","\"Issuer FY26 results: ₹390.2 crore revenue, EBITDA loss ₹4 crore and PAT ₹5.3 crore. Skills demand does not guarantee operating profitability.\"","\"PEER-CLE\"","\"CL Educate FY26 annual report\"","\"https://www.cleducate.com/pdf/annual-reports/2026/CL-Educate-Annual-Report-2025-26.pdf\"","\"FY2026 issued2026\"","\"cf8007a1bcb9732d228a288bb967c9e290cdaabc5fb6b3c7d627f999b2be2643\"","\"FY26 business model, franchise network and acquisition bridge: ₹548.1 crore revenue and about ₹26 crore net loss. First full year of DEXIT changes perimeter.\"","\"PEER-STEM\"","\"STEMROBO official business description\"","\"https://www.stemrobo.com/about-us/\"","\"Undated, retrieved2026-10-23\"","\"9f8c419b0f312b94e8f6e533e7b9b4e8b280c1bef460667892a1c520bb938e58\"","\"Direct curriculum/kits/AI robotics lab competitor; undated web description used only to identify mechanism, not assert historical scale or financial performance.\"","\"claim\"","\"detail\"","\"sources\"","\"counter_evidence\"","\"supporting_facts\"","\"Historical audit opinions and controls\"","\"Original FY21 opinion qualifies Income Tax Act depreciation with unascertained effect. FY25 is unmodified but identifies confirmation/GST uncertainty and a CARO lender mismatch.\"","\"FY22–24 opinions are unmodified; FY25 IFC and audit-trail observations are positive.\"","\"Original FY21 opinion qualifies Income Tax Act depreciation with unascertained effect\"","\"FY25 is unmodified but identifies confirmation/GST uncertainty and a CARO lender mismatch.\"","\"Restatement and cash-flow reliability\"","\"RHP restatements change depreciation, interest, gratuity, stock, purchases and tax. Original FY25 CFO includes ₹5.6544 crore borrowing; FY26 investing rows differ from the reported subtotal by ₹0.0687 crore.\"","\"The restated examination reports no qualifications requiring adjustment, but this does not resolve all original-to-restated cash differences.\"","\"RHP restatements change depreciation, interest, gratuity, stock, purchases and tax\"","\"Original FY25 CFO includes ₹5.6544 crore borrowing; FY26 investing rows differ from the reported subtotal by ₹0.0687 crore.\"","\"Promoter and related-party economics\"","\"The disclosed October 2020–March 2021 director appointment overlaps a disqualification period. FY25 RPT sales were ₹33.7505 crore and acquisition consideration ₹5.1714 crore is payable to KMP.\"","\"The disqualification period lapsed and no proceeding is disclosed; no diversion is proven.\"","\"The disclosed October 2020–March 2021 director appointment overlaps a disqualification period\"","\"FY25 RPT sales were ₹33.7505 crore and acquisition consideration ₹5.1714 crore is payable to KMP.\"","\"Business segments and customers\"","\"FY26 labs/subscriptions/other services are ₹72.0167/₹11.9284/₹9.2780 crore. Top customer/top ten are 21.11%/77.99%, and most relationships lack binding long-term agreements.\"","\"Recorded growth and broader geography show delivered scale; retention and IP monetization are not quantified.\"","\"FY26 labs/subscriptions/other services are ₹72.0167/₹11.9284/₹9.2780 crore\"","\"Top customer/top ten are 21.11%/77.99%, and most relationships lack binding long-term agreements.\"","\"Economic peers and moat test\"","\"NIIT Learning Systems discloses annuity clients and contracted visibility. NIIT Limited and CL Educate show that learning demand, franchise scale or acquisition revenue need not produce strong shareholder earnings.\"","\"V/M\"","\"Peers differ materially in customer, contract, scale and financing economics; no peer P/E is transferred. STEMROBO is an undated mechanism comparator only.\"","\"NIIT Learning Systems discloses annuity clients and contracted visibility\"","\"NIIT Limited and CL Educate show that learning demand, franchise scale or acquisition revenue need not produce strong shareholder earnings.\"","\"Growth and acquisition perimeter\"","\"RRPL was acquired on March 30, 2026; its full-year ₹41.6372 crore sales and ₹4.3092 crore profit are not added to group FY26. The post-acquisition loss is ₹0.0589 crore; the small parent/group service difference is not a full organic bridge.\"","\"V/C\"","\"Lab and subscription growth is substantial; unresolved scope is not proof that recorded sales are fictitious.\"","\"RRPL was acquired on March 30, 2026; its full-year ₹41.6372 crore sales and ₹4.3092 crore profit are not added to group FY26\"","\"The post-acquisition loss is ₹0.0589 crore; the small parent/group service difference is not a full organic bridge.\"","\"Execution and IPO objects\"","\"Two franchise and two direct centres were operating at RHP date. IPO objects allocate ₹23.4573 crore to working capital and ₹2.2 crore to debt repayment, with actual use unverified by cutoff.\"","\"The IPO completed and delivered lab revenue rose; larger centre ambitions and internal-accrual forecasts remain management assumptions.\"","\"Two franchise and two direct centres were operating at RHP date\"","\"IPO objects allocate ₹23.4573 crore to working capital and ₹2.2 crore to debt repayment, with actual use unverified by cutoff.\"","\"Cash, working capital and capital returns\"","\"March cash equivalents are ₹0.2187 crore versus debt ₹29.8033 crore, receivables ₹71.2776 crore and restricted/unproven available deposits ₹5.7954 crore. Restated CFO is negative in each of FY24–26.\"","\"Higher project sales and acquired capital explain some balance growth; the acquired/organic capital split remains unresolved.\"","\"March cash equivalents are ₹0.2187 crore versus debt ₹29.8033 crore, receivables ₹71.2776 crore and restricted/unproven available deposits ₹5.7954 crore\"","\"Restated CFO is negative in each of FY24–26.\"","\"Earnings definition and tax cash\"","\"KPI EBITDA ₹16.6580 crore uses interest-only ₹2.5805 crore. Adding all finance costs and excluding other income gives operating EBITDA ₹16.5326 crore; CFO includes a positive ₹1.9384 crore tax refund.\"","\"Other income is modest relative to profit, and normalized operating earnings still improved.\"","\"KPI EBITDA ₹16.6580 crore uses interest-only ₹2.5805 crore\"","\"Adding all finance costs and excluding other income gives operating EBITDA ₹16.5326 crore; CFO includes a positive ₹1.9384 crore tax refund.\"","\"Funding and dilution\"","\"April equity cash was ₹2.750024 crore and OCD cash ₹4.4999955 crore; September OCD conversion issued 582,900 shares with no second cash inflow. IPO shares produce current capital 10,859,453 against 12,000,000 authorized shares.\"","\"V/A\"","\"The completed fresh IPO is real funding, but subsequent cash, debt, claim settlement and utilization are not independently verified.\"","\"April equity cash was ₹2.750024 crore and OCD cash ₹4.4999955 crore; September OCD conversion issued 582,900 shares with no second cash inflow\"","\"IPO shares produce current capital 10,859,453 against 12,000,000 authorized shares.\"","\"Conditional model and earned valuation\"","\"The 67-period model retains pre-entry and within-period timing, capped optional bank draws and whole-share rescue equity. First failures never receive ordinary returns; all debt and continuing operating cash requirements precede terminal equity.\"","\"Analyst assumptions\"","\"A\"","\"Forecast cash timings, uncommitted financing and terminal economics are analyst assumptions, not observed interim accounts or a prediction of default.\"","\"The 67-period model retains pre-entry and within-period timing, capped optional bank draws and whole-share rescue equity\"","\"First failures never receive ordinary returns; all debt and continuing operating cash requirements precede terminal equity.\"","\"Price and implementation\"","\"Secondary Finology shows ₹149.80 on October 19; the primary security master verifies 10,859,453 shares and 1,200-share lot. The primary daily tape attempts failed, and the listing has fewer than 20 sessions.\"","\"Secondary trading observations do not establish executable depth or current restrictions; missing tape is not zero trading.\"","\"Secondary Finology shows ₹149.80 on October 19; the primary security master verifies 10,859,453 shares and 1,200-share lot\"","\"The primary daily tape attempts failed, and the listing has fewer than 20 sessions.\"","\"rows\"","\"conclusion\"","\"original_date\"","\"commitment\"","\"outcome\"","\"FY2024–FY2026\"","\"Observable lab execution, not earnings guidance\"","\"Lab revenue ₹32.2526 → ₹53.2461 → ₹72.0167 crore\"","\"RHP printed122\"","\"Delivered revenue; cash realization not proven by revenue\"","\"2026-09-11 RHP\"","\"Franchise-led activity-centre expansion\"","\"Two franchise and two direct centres operating; larger network aspiration is not committed openings\"","\"RHP printed127\"","\"Early operations; unit economics ND\"","\"2026-07-01 board / RHP\"","\"FY27 IPO working capital ₹23.4573 crore and loan repayment ₹2.2 crore\"","\"Listing completed September 28; application of proceeds not independently verified by October 20\"","\"RHP printed pp 82–92; mirrored BSE listing notice\"","\"Fundingraised; utilization pending\"","\"Deliver to agreed project timelines\"","\"Late-deployment penalties ₹0.0190/₹0.0238/₹0.0036 crore\"","\"RHP RFS27\"","\"Penalties declining but not zero\"","\"Management attributes growth to retention and new customers\"","\"No renewal rate, customer cohort or ARR bridge disclosed\"","\"RHP printed194\"","\"Management statement only\"","\"EXEC 5: mixed. Recognize completed milestones without treating future working-capital estimates as achieved execution.\"","\"full_audit_history\"","\"reconciliations\"","\"omissions\"","\"pages\"","\"finding\"","\"FY21\"","\"PDF8–11\"","\"Qualified depreciation under the Income Tax Act, with unascertained profit impact; retirement benefits not actuarially provided. No invented numerical earnings correction.\"","\"FY22\"","\"PDF8–14\"","\"Unmodified, no KAM and IFC exemption; inventory existence wording does not prove independent verification.\"","\"FY23\"","\"PDF8–15\"","\"Unmodified, no KAM and IFC exemption; comparative finance cost changes without a corresponding PBT change.\"","\"FY24\"","\"PDF8–16\"","\"Unmodified, no KAM; subsidiary-investment CARO clause predates reported acquisition, and GST overdue timing wording is inconsistent.\"","\"FY25\"","\"PDF11–25\"","\"Unmodified with confirmation/GST KAM; CARO lender differs from financial notes. Positive IFC and audit trail are counter-evidence.\"","\"FY26\"","\"PDF181–234 /RFS1–54\"","\"Full restated examination and RFS1–54 reviewed; separate FY26 statutory audit annexures were not located, so no independent full CARO clearance is claimed.\"","\"item\"","\"reported\"","\"alternative_all_finance_cost\"","\"normalized_operating\"","\"explanation\"","\"Operating EBITDA\"","\"16.658\"","\"17.0257\"","\"16.5326\"","\"Interest-only KPI adds ₹2.5805 crore; full finance cost is ₹2.9482 crore, including bank/statutory/MSME costs. Remove other income ₹0.4931 crore; definitions are not silently mixed.\"","\"netassetsatacquisition\"","\"capitalreserve\"","\"Acquisition book capital\"","\"9.5217\"","\"Closing RRPL net assets ₹9.4628 crore plus post-acquisition loss ₹0.0589 crore reconstruct acquisition net assets. Fund the complete consideration once; do not add full-year RRPL profit.\"","\"original_CFO\"","\"restated_CFO\"","\"known_original_financing_in_CFO\"","\"unallocated_difference\"","\"FY25 original to restatedCFO\"","\"5.9767\"","\"5.6544\"","\"2.4204\"","\"Original CFO less borrowing is ₹0.3223 crore, still ₹2.4204 crore above restated CFO. Original FY24 closing cash ₹0.2338 crore versus restated ₹1.6346 crore includes CC/OD reclassification and other differences; full bridge unresolved.\"","\"reported_subtotal\"","\"sum_printed_rows\"","\"residual\"","\"FY26 investing cash flow arithmetic\"","\"Printed rows do not sum to the reported subtotal. Reported subtotals do reconcile to net cash change; preserve both and keep G2 Hold.\"","\"No raw PDFs or OCR included in deliverable; only authored findings and primary-sourceURLs/hashes. Retrieval failures not converted into factual adverse conclusions.\"","\"FinInstrmId\"","\"TckrSymb\"","\"SctySrs\"","\"FinInstrmNm\"","\"ISIN\"","\"NewBrdLotQty\"","\"ParVal\"","\"SctyTpFlg\"